    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple &amp; retro Tank shotting game. what you need is moving, aiming and shotting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently we only have 1 map, no boss or plot. The only task is try to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/cd10031bdae10d140d2bb41b5c44e23c.avif?t=1753874187\" width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can equip 1 ability card at start menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then we will get 4 random cards during level up, Player need select 1 to power up attribute or ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/507a1973158185229c2c73c29e573c68.avif?t=1753874187\" width=764 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy also can level up via time goes, level up attribute is randomly. Player can select power up direction accordingly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/f4a4b0d1e77bc5ae750416d1c88b8b91.avif?t=1753874187\" width=291 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy can explode once player nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also have environment system, you need judge enemy's position by sound during night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/742bca668c7c657a60f8754967638114.avif?t=1753874187\" width=695 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can press E button once collect more than 1 ability card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability also could be power up by mutiply cards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple &amp; retro Tank shotting game. what you need is moving, aiming and shotting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently we only have 1 map, no boss or plot. The only task is try to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/cd10031bdae10d140d2bb41b5c44e23c.avif?t=1753874187\" width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can equip 1 ability card at start menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then we will get 4 random cards during level up, Player need select 1 to power up attribute or ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/507a1973158185229c2c73c29e573c68.avif?t=1753874187\" width=764 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy also can level up via time goes, level up attribute is randomly. Player can select power up direction accordingly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/f4a4b0d1e77bc5ae750416d1c88b8b91.avif?t=1753874187\" width=291 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy can explode once player nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also have environment system, you need judge enemy's position by sound during night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872380/extras/742bca668c7c657a60f8754967638114.avif?t=1753874187\" width=695 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can press E button once collect more than 1 ability card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability also could be power up by mutiply cards.</p>",
